  3.970780085036179*^9, 
  3.970780127598443*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"af677639-1474-4d24-a4d8-\
0754c6ed3b9a"],

Cell["\<\
Here we use the values of livestock birth and death rates estimated from the \
village level data above, along with the maximum likelihood estimates for \
model parameters \[Beta], \[ScriptCapitalA], and \[Rho], and fixed values of \
the fixed parameters \[Gamma] and \[Omega]  to simulate seroprevalence in \
livestock and the force of infection into the human population for each \
village. We then compare the simulated values to those estimated from the \
age-structured human seroprevalence data.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9707801351948223`*^9, 3.9707802293962517`*^9}, {
  3.970917712119054*^9, 3.970917731897634*^9}, {3.971172509958475*^9, 
  3.971172518104063*^9}, {3.971172593295693*^9, 3.9711726370278397`*^9}, {
  3.971541378764285*^9, 
  3.971541386676235*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"aa54220b-e4f1-4f43-825d-\
fd26fbc91f32"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

